*JAMB 2026: What Every Student Must Know Before Registration Begins*

The Joint Admissions and Matriculation Board has announced that registration for the 2026 Unified Tertiary Matriculation Examination will soon begin across all approved CBT centres in Nigeria. Every student who wants to gain admission into university, polytechnic, or college of education must prepare early to avoid last-minute stress and mistakes.

First, make sure your NIN is ready and linked to your phone number. Without a valid NIN, you cannot create your JAMB profile code. To create it, send NIN followed by your 11-digit NIN number to 55019 or 66019. Keep the profile code safe because you will need it at the CBT centre.

